Package: coolboxr
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for CoolBox
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CoolBox", "Maintainers", email = "opensource@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: R bindings for a broad set of CoolBox C++ components.
    The package exposes native decision trees, support vector machines,
    Bayesian networks, hidden Markov models, linear regression, multi-arm
    bandits, marked point processes, piecewise conditional intensity models,
    latent sentiment analysis, singular value decomposition, principal
    component analysis, k-nearest neighbors, UMAP, and time-series utilities
    backed by existing CoolBox implementations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MeanderingAI/CoolBox
BugReports: https://github.com/MeanderingAI/CoolBox/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    devtools,
    pkgdown,
    roxygen2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
